Server init.

>> x := Blob ny: 65 type: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Program indstilling: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server forbind: (
 Liste ny ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Liste ny ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x fra: 0 længde: 1), stop.
x frigiv.

